<title>USA: Purus rescinds cash distribution plan.</title>
<headline>Purus rescinds cash distribution plan.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Purus Inc said its board rescinded a previous proposal to make a $3.00 per share cash distribution, which was subject to stockholder ratification.  </p>
<p>The company said the board determined that payment of the distribution was not in the best interests of the company and its stockholders.</p>
</text>
